    "theorem": "ThreeTangentPairingAudit.actual_three_tangent_pairing_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem actual_three_tangent_pairing_certificate : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] [IsAlgClosed K] [NeZero (3:K)] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K), W.Δ≠0 → (∀ P Q : ThreeTorsion W, (tangentPair W P.val Q.val)^3=1) ∧ (∀ P Q R : ThreeTorsion W, tangentPair W (P+Q).val R.val=tangentPair W P.val R.val*tangentPair W Q.val R.val ∧ tangentPair W P.val (Q+R).val=tangentPair W P.val Q.val*tangentPair W P.val R.val) ∧ (∀ P : ThreeTorsion W, tangentPair W P.val P.val=1) ∧ (∀ P Q : ThreeTorsion W, tangentPair W P.val Q.val=(tangentPair W Q.val P.val)⁻¹) ∧ (∀ P : ThreeTorsion W, (∀ Q : ThreeTorsion W, tangentPair W P.val Q.val=1) → P=0) ∧ (∀ Q : ThreeTorsion W, (∀ P : ThreeTorsion W, tangentPair W P.val Q.val=1) → Q=0) ∧ (∀ P : ThreeTorsion W, P≠0 → ∃ Q : Submodule.span (ZMod 3) {P}, Q≠0 ∧ ∀ R : Submodule.span (ZMod 3) {P}, tangentPair W Q.val.val R.val.val=1)) ∧ (∀ (F A B : Type) [Field F] [Field A] [Field B] [Algebra F A] [Algebra F B] [DecidableEq A] [DecidableEq B] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F) (f : A →ₐ[F] B) (P Q : (W.baseChange A).Point), tangentPair (W.baseChange B) (actualMappedPoint F A B W f P) (actualMappedPoint F A B W f Q)= f (tangentPair (W.baseChange A) P Q)) ∧ (∀ (F L : Type) [Field F] [Fintype F] [Field L] [Algebra F L] [DecidableEq F] [DecidableEq L] [IsAlgClosed L] [NeZero (3:L)] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F), W.Δ≠0 → (∀ b : Basis (Fin 2) (ZMod 3) (ThreeTorsion (W.baseChange L)), (frobeniusMatrix W b).det=(Fintype.card F : ZMod 3)) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [Fintype K] [Algebra F K] [Algebra K L] [IsScalarTower F K L] [DecidableEq K] (k : ℕ), Fintype.card K=Fintype.card F^k → (∀ P : (W.baseChange L).Point, (3:ℕ) • P=0 → P∈Set.range (pointInclusion F K L W)) → 3 ∣ Fintype.card F^k-1)) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] [CharP K 3], (ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.curve (1:K) 1).Δ≠0 ∧ ∃ P : ThreeTorsion (ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.curve (1:K) 1), P≠0 ∧ ∀ Q : ThreeTorsion (ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.curve (1:K) 1), tangentPair (ThreeTorsionCharacterAudit.curve (1:K) 1) P.val Q.val=1) ∧ (binaryCurve.Δ≠0 ∧ ∃ P Q : ThreeTorsion binaryCurve, (tangentPair binaryCurve P.val Q.val)^3=1 ∧ tangentPair binaryCurve P.val Q.val≠1)",
    "decl_sha256": "0315aa3c3afc383f33716cf70c3ccd8fc73b92aaec58f2b5a1d71baaf12990e5",
    "scope": "Actual explicit tangent pairing on actualgeometric3-killed subgroup of every nonsingular generalWeierstrasscurve overalgebraicallyclosedfieldchar!=3 including2; infinity/equal-x value1, otherwise −normalized-y-tangentP(Q)/tangentQ(P). Actualdomainnonzero, normalization/creditedcubiccharacter identity, bothbilinear laws/alternation/skew/cube1/bothradicalszero. Actualfieldmap/Frobeniusqpowercovariance; actualbasiscoordinate determinantpairing formula/nontrivialprimitivebasisvalue. Genericall-model finitebase actualFrobeniusdet=qmod3 ineverybasis, no rationalfixedpoint/countdivisibility/normalfamily/determinantpremise. Chosencompatiblefinitefieldfullgeometric3torsion forces3|q^k−1 without rationalpointcount premise. Actualordinarychar3nonsingularcurve/nonzeroactual3torsionpoint pairs1withallactualkernel; actualcyclicSubmodulespanrestrictiondegenerate; creditedactualbinarycurve supportsnewnontrivialcube-root pairing. Knownactualrank3/normalcharacter/grouptransport/Frobenius/descent credited, establishedmethods/no novelty. CanonicalWeilidentification/reciprocity/generalprime≥5rankdet/fullallkp500census/remaining14open; qualifiedsourcesretained. Tennewconcretemodules/33frozenlocalmodules0copies/54oldformalconfigs65oldformal-artifactpins eachstate/gate. Defaultlimits/standardfoundations/noholes/customaxioms/nativeproofeval/newglobalflags/waivers/frozenedits/cryptoPython/nativecryptoexperiment/spend/upload. Sameprover/host/frozenproceduralheadercheck, no parser-hash-compiler-independenthostrefinement; signedunverified.",
